# Line endings
#
# Every text file in this repository is stored and checked out with Unix
# (LF) line endings. Without this, opening and saving a page on Windows —
# or on a network volume that rewrites line endings on its own — silently
# converts the file to CRLF. Nothing about the page changes, but git then
# reports every line of every page as modified, which buries any real edit
# in thousands of lines of noise. `eol=lf` keeps that from happening.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets. Git must never rewrite line endings inside these, and
# never try to show a line-by-line diff of them.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.pdf   binary
